        property: name
        value: Aenar Targaryen
        confidence: high
        status: accepted
        citations:
            - citation-twoiaf-targaryen
        notes: 'Verified against TWOIAF, The Targaryen Kings section. Aenar the Exile, who brought the Targaryens to Dragonstone before the Doom. Source text: The Targaryens were of pure Valyrian blood, dragonlords of ancient lineage. Twelve years before the Doom of Valyria (114 BC), Aenar Targaryen sold his holdings in the Freehold and the Lands of the Long Summer and moved with all his wives, wealth, slaves, dragons, siblings, kin, and children to Dragonstone'
